f50-r07\", \"record_sha256\": \"55cde9778408cc146f262868660b0effa2a32a51e82b64866a93a7b6b1b43abe\", \"report_sha256\": \"d10585450dc9f48137e107bd35446198536b4c94fe309f3b5a359df03114d3b1\", \"core_memory_id\": \"80832613-92dd-41d8-a310-1e4d63f7f377\", \"receipt_sha256\": \"73ba4de90cae13005579526f7c09a6710f3ae04d7d4f9d285f48cdb9b734ed7e\", \"comparison_run_id\": \"5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50\", \"replaces_record_id\": \"\", \"core_provenance_kind\": \"import\", \"replaces_core_memory_id\": \"\"}","attachment_ids":null,"semantic_similarity":0.7958207604778266,"bm25_score":null,"rrf_score":0.012658227848101266,"rrf_rank":19,"semantic_rank":19,"cross_encoder_score":0.000012511810382420663,"cross_encoder_score_normalized":0.000012511810382420663,"rrf_normalized":0.0,"temporal":0.5,"recency":0.9753424657534246,"proof_norm":0.5,"combined_score":0.00001370128934206449,"weight":0.00001370128934206449,"activation":0.00001370128934206449},{"id":"3e417e7a-ffdb-4528-b493-05a352d880d7","text":"Record replaces_core_memory_id is unset | When: 2026-10-01T00:00:00Z","fact_type":"world","context":"","event_date":"2026-10-01T00:00:00.060000Z","occurred_start":null,"occurred_end":null,"mentioned_at":"2026-10-01T00:00:00.060000+00:00","document_id":"5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-r05","chunk_id":"zelo-5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-public_5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-r05_0","tags":["public","r05"],"metadata":"{\"scope_id\": \"6de15ab1-e992-49a6-9be8-fe0cf5c0c676\", \"record_id\": \"r05\", \"scope_key\": \"public\", \"source_id\": \"youtube\", \"created_at\": \"2026-10-01T00:00:00Z\", \"expires_at\": \"\", \"scope_kind\": \"project\", \"document_id\": \"5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-r05\", \"record_sha256\": \"277f0fc5c14c2387fcfe78b332d524fad550caea0e26408e0f9cb19cd2e4111d\", \"report_sha256\": \"d10585450dc9f48137e107bd35446198536b4c94fe309f3b5a359df03114d3b1\", \"core_memory_id\": \"168c490b-cb72-49c2-a800-2e4949c9ee32\", \"receipt_sha256\": \"73ba4de90cae13005579526f7c09a6710f3ae04d7d4f9d285f48cdb9b734ed7e\", \"comparison_run_id\": \"5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50\", \"replaces_record_id\": \"\", \"core_provenance_kind\": \"import\", \"replaces_core_memory_id\": \"\"}","attachment_ids":null,"semantic_similarity":0.7993558167835314,"bm25_score":null,"rrf_score":0.013157894736842105,"rrf_rank":17,"semantic_rank":16,"cross_encoder_score":0.000012447139852156397,"cross_encoder_score_normalized":0.000012447139852156397,"rrf_normalized":0.0,"temporal":0.5,"recency":0.9753424676560122,"proof_norm":0.5,"combined_score":0.0000136304706866731,"weight":0.0000136304706866731,"activation":0.0000136304706866731}]},"entities":null,"chunks":{"zelo-5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-public_5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-r04_0":{"id":"zelo-5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-public_5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-r04_0","text":"Agent-Reach Web check selects Jina Reader and returns the literal status ok without a network request. This readiness result does not prove that Jina Reader or any target page was retrieved.","chunk_index":0,"truncated":false,"attachments":null},"zelo-5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-public_5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-r06_0":{"id":"zelo-5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-public_5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-r06_0","text":"After a successful yt-dlp probe, Agent-Reach YouTube readiness checks for Deno or Node. In the Node-present, Deno-absent branch, _has_js_runtime_config calls read_small_text_no_follow with max_bytes=1024*1024 and checks the returned text for the literal substring --js-runtimes. It does not parse or validate the flag's effective value; the reading helper was not inspected. Missing that substring leads to a warn branch.","chunk_index":0,"truncated":false,"attachments":null},"zelo-5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-public_5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-r05_0":{"id":"zelo-5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-public_5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-r05_0","text":"Agent-Reach YouTube readiness invokes probe_command for yt-dlp with [--version], timeout=10 and package=yt-dlp. A missing probe status yields off; broken or another non-ok probe yields error. It does not download a video in this check.","chunk_index":0,"truncated":false,"attachments":null},"zelo-5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-public_5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-r03_0":{"id":"zelo-5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-public_5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-r03_0","text":"Agent-Reach Web read first calls normalize_public_http_url and requests https://r.jina.ai/ followed by that normalized URL. urlopen receives timeout=30. It calls resp.read(5*1024*1024+1), requesting up to that many bytes, and raises ValueError when the returned body exceeds 5*1024*1024 bytes (5 MiB). The shown timeout argument is not proof of an end-to-end deadline.","chunk_index":0,"truncated":false,"attachments":null},"zelo-5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-public_5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-r01_0":{"id":"zelo-5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-public_5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-r01_0","text":"Agent-Reach RSS readiness imports feedparser. ImportError yields off; another import-time exception yields error; a successful import yields ok and selects feedparser. This check does not fetch a feed.","chunk_index":0,"truncated":false,"attachments":null},"zelo-5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-public_5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-r02_0":{"id":"zelo-5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-public_5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-r02_0","text":"Agent-Reach RSS can_handle lowercases the URL and tests whether any of the substrings /feed, /rss, .xml or atom occurs in it. This is URL substring matching, not parsing or fetching RSS/Atom content.","chunk_index":0,"truncated":false,"attachments":null},"zelo-5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-public_5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-r07_0":{"id":"zelo-5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-public_5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-r07_0","text":"Agent-Reach YouTube transcribe defaults provider to auto and allow_provider_fallback to False and passes both to the lazily imported agent_reach.transcribe.transcribe helper. That helper's implementation was not inspected, so its actual transcription and fallback behavior remain unknown.","chunk_index":0,"truncated":false,"attachments":null}},"source_facts":null,"source_facts_truncated":null}